                  "content": "Final lineup: Interval, Meditation, Tabata, EMOM, Pomodoro.\nNumbers: Azeret Mono (explicitly approved).\nAll routes, states and behavior in the final handoff.\nSource code and author links live on About.\nFooter navigation: Timers / About only.",
