    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "eTCi2",
      "x": 5650,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Tabata · EMOM · Pomodoro / Implementation",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1280,
      "fill": "$paper",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "padding": 48,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "u74v5w",
          "name": "Implementation title",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tabata / EMOM / Pomodoro",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 36,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "HFZ8a",
          "name": "Implementation scope",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "36 screens · 375 & 1280 · State and implementation contract",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "o70Xsw",
          "name": "01 / Shared contract — applies to every screen",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "01 / Shared contract — applies to every screen",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ux2Jl",
          "name": "01 / Shared contract — applies to every screen · notes",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Read the latest task brief as the authority. These are copies of the supplied Interval idle/work/rest/done screens, not a new component family. Existing $paper/$ink/$muted/$line/$accent/$soft and $sans/$digits only. Azeret Mono ($digits) for the timer and numeric values; DM Sans ($sans) for UI. DOM and visual order: remaining digits → phase word + icon → round/minute context → settings or progress → actions → Timers/About. Never move navigation above the clock.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vtqJP",
          "name": "02 / Responsive, input and accessibility",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "02 / Responsive, input and accessibility",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "uf4TZ",
          "name": "02 / Responsive, input and accessibility · notes",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "375: 20px gutters, 98px clock. 1280: 64px gutters, 208px clock. Preserve order and use flexible sizing between widths. Footer links: Timers / About only. Audio is separate and quiet, with explicit On/Off text, a 44px target and aria-pressed. Desktop shortcuts: Space start/pause/resume, Esc stop, R reset; ignore edited fields and modifiers. Visible focus, labeled steppers and phase announcements; never announce every second.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ormEy",
          "name": "03 / Shared errors and destructive actions — main-session patterns",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "03 / Shared errors and destructive actions — main-session patterns",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "B4TKLA",
          "name": "03 / Shared errors and destructive actions — main-session patterns · notes",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Reuse Shared · Invalid input (375 QcuC7 / 1280 ZIw5f), Stop confirmation (R5tQNU / m9KzG), and Reset confirmation (rh8e0 / xkvqh); main agent owns these patterns. Empty, decimal, nonnumeric and out-of-range typed values remain visible with a specific inline error and aria-describedby; disable Start, focus the first invalid input on attempted submission. Never silently coerce typed invalid values. Steppers move by 1, stop at bounds, announce disabled limits; hold repeats after 400ms. Settings are locked during running/paused states.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WgNDR",
          "name": "04 / Stop, reset, navigation and recovery",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "04 / Stop, reset, navigation and recovery",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "X3l6e",
          "name": "04 / Stop, reset, navigation and recovery · notes",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Stop/Esc, reset/R and navigation away during active or paused sessions use the shared full-panel confirmation state. Freeze time/audio. Keep going or Esc restores the exact prior state. Confirm Stop or Reset returns to setup retaining values; Stop may continue a requested navigation. R in setup retains settings and resets the preview, not factory defaults. No confirmation from setup/Done. These are not modal overlays: announce the question, move focus, and restore focus on cancel; do not trap focus.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "k6MKO",
          "name": "05 / Timing, sound and unavailable capabilities",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "05 / Timing, sound and unavailable capabilities",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "syMRX",
          "name": "05 / Timing, sound and unavailable capabilities · notes",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Use monotonic phase deadlines and elapsed active time; pause stores phase, remaining milliseconds, index and total remainder, cancels pending cues and wake lock. Resume uses stored remainder without advancing the phase. At zero advance exactly once; render mm:ss with ceiling rounding, use >59-minute values (e.g. 93:32) without truncation. Progress = active elapsed / full finite duration, frozen when paused. Background return reconciles elapsed time without a burst of missed sounds. Start gesture unlocks audio; blocked/unavailable audio shows a quiet status and retry via the audio control, timer continues visually. Wake-lock failure is non-blocking. Storage failure keeps valid settings in memory; missing/corrupt saved values fall back to defaults with a quiet notice. Reuse main-session error/status presentation; never introduce separate timer-specific dialogs.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "J5P1R2",
          "name": "06 / Tabata — fixed classic preset",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "06 / Tabata — fixed classic preset",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Dogq1",
          "name": "06 / Tabata — fixed classic preset · notes",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "No adjustable fields: 20 seconds Work / 10 seconds Rest / 8 rounds, 04:00 total. This is deliberately the fewest-settings path. Start immediately enters Work round 1. Each Work → Rest, each Rest → next Work; include final 10-second rest after round 8, then Done. Validate persisted preset exactly as 20/10/8; stale or malformed custom values restore this preset.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dmM1O",
          "name": "07 / EMOM — one setting, no rest",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "07 / EMOM — interval length and total minutes",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "GAOw5",
          "name": "07 / EMOM — one setting, no rest · notes",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Interval length: 15–300 seconds, default 60, step ±1 second. Total minutes: 1–99, default 10, step ±1 minute. Both editable. Total = minutes × 60 seconds. Current-interval clock resets each boundary; final interval is capped by remaining total time. At 60 seconds show Minute n of N. Otherwise show elapsed minute count and Interval i of ceil(total/interval). No rest phase; participants use remaining seconds themselves.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "T3K6V",
          "name": "08 / Pomodoro — finite cycle",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "08 / Pomodoro — finite cycle",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jcs6Q",
          "name": "08 / Pomodoro — finite cycle · notes",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Defaults: Focus 25min, Short break 5min, Long break 15min, Focus sessions 4. Minutes are integers 1–180; focus sessions integer 1–12; step ±1 in each field. Total = focus × sessions + short × (sessions−1) + long; default 130 minutes. Focus 1 → Short break → Focus 2 → Short break → Focus 3 → Short break → Focus 4 → Long break → Done. Automatically advance at each boundary; no automatic new cycle after Done. With 1 focus session, Focus → Long break → Done. Editing setup recomputes the clock and summary immediately when valid.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DG7Jh",
          "name": "09 / Completion and paused-phase contract",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "09 / Completion and paused-phase contract",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "z9wwsM",
          "name": "09 / Completion and paused-phase contract · notes",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every Done screen shows 00:00, check icon, completion counts, full progress and total duration. Main actions ONLY Run again and Change settings. Run again starts a fresh session with the same valid settings; Change settings returns to idle/setup retaining values. No share/save/extra completion actions. Paused Tabata screenshot represents Work; the same screen must also show “Paused · Rest” with rest icon/context and its frozen remainder when paused from Rest. Paused Pomodoro screenshot represents Focus; use “Paused · Short break” or “Paused · Long break” and the corresponding break icon/context when paused there. Keep the Resume target in place. EMOM paused retains the current minute index and remainder. Never reset or skip a phase on pause/resume.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Y0tkf",
          "name": "10 / Per-screen implementation index",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "10 / Per-screen implementation index",
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Oq7oY",
          "name": "Tabata/Idle · screen-specific notes",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tabata · Idle\n375 → LvtdA     |     1280 → IE5ET\n00:20 preview; fixed 20/10/8 preset and 04:00 summary, no input fields. Start enters Work 1 immediately.\n375: stacked content, no key hints. 1280: centered desktop layout, Space / Esc / R hints. Shared contracts 01–05 and 09 apply to both.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "P2cff",
          "name": "Tabata/Work · screen-specific notes",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tabata · Work\n375 → z5bba     |     1280 → X639r\n00:12 in Work round 3/8; 02:52 session remaining; Next Rest 00:10. Pause freezes this phase; zero enters Rest 3.\n375: stacked content, no key hints. 1280: centered desktop layout, Space / Esc / R hints. Shared contracts 01–05 and 09 apply to both.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
