          "content": "Tabata · Paused\n375 → BP1IS     |     1280 → vvenm\n00:12 frozen in Work 3/8; Resume continues Work 3, Stop uses shared confirmation. Rest pause variant retains its own time/count and says Paused · Rest.\n375: stacked content, no key hints. 1280: centered desktop layout, Space / Esc / R hints. Shared contracts 01–05 and 09 apply to both.",
