          "content": "Tabata · Done\n375 → vuWXy     |     1280 → x38ByO\n8/8 completed, 04:00 total. Run again → Work 1 at 00:20; Change settings → fixed-preset Idle.\n375: stacked content, no key hints. 1280: centered desktop layout, Space / Esc / R hints. Shared contracts 01–05 and 09 apply to both.",
