          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "EMOM · Run\n375 → zfMZl     |     1280 → xbFS1\n00:42 remaining in minute 3/10; 07:42 session remaining; Next Minute 4. Zero begins minute 4 at 01:00 without a rest phase.\n375: stacked content, no key hints. 1280: centered desktop layout, Space / Esc / R hints. Shared contracts 01–05 and 09 apply to both.",
