          "content": "Pomodoro · Setup\n375 → ZvmXK     |     1280 → Ah2LY\n25:00 preview with four editable fields: 25, 5, 15, 4; 130-minute summary. Start begins Focus 1. Validate all fields using shared inline errors.\n375: stacked content, no key hints. 1280: centered desktop layout, Space / Esc / R hints. Shared contracts 01–05 and 09 apply to both.",
